{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 16, "model_name": "stockmark/stockmark-2-100b-instruct", "content": "To fair Japan's land, thou dost set forth, oh brave traveler,\n\nDay One, set thy feet upon the soil of Tokyo,\nMorning doth see thy visit to the hallowed Senso-ji Temple,\nWherein thou dost seek the wisdom of the ancients,\nAt noon, dine at the renowned sushi restaurant,\nWhere the freshest of fish doth grace thy palate,\nIn the afternoon, stroll through the avenues of Shibuya,\nMarveling at the throngs of life, a sea of humanity,\nEvening brings thee to the tranquil Meiji Shrine,\nWherein the spirits of the departed doth whisper to thee,\n\nDay Two, venture to the city of Kyoto, once the capital,\nMorning, visit the Kinkaku-ji Temple, the Golden Pavilion,\nGlittering in the sun, a sight for sore eyes,\nAt noon, partake in a traditional tea ceremony,\nWherein the art of hospitality doth shine,\nIn the afternoon, explore the serene Arashiyama Bamboo Grove,\nA verdant tunnel, a path of green, a wonder to behold,\nEvening, doth see thee attend a Kabuki performance,\nA spectacle of color, of song, and of dance, a feast for the senses,\n\nDay Three, to the city of Osaka thou dost go,\nMorning, ascend the Tower of the Sun, a beacon in the sky,\nAwe-inspiring views of the city, a vista to remember,\nAt noon, sample the street food of Dotonbori,\nA culinary adventure, a delight for the taste buds,\nIn the afternoon, visit the Osaka Castle, a fortress of might,\nA journey through history, a tale of lore,\nEvening, doth see thee return to Tokyo,\nTo the neon lights of Shinjuku, a vibrant nightlife,\n\nThus, thy journey through Japan doth come to a close,\nWith memories to treasure, and stories to tell,\nOf temples and sushi, of Kabuki and green groves,\nOf the land of the rising sun, a traveler's tale to tell.", "logprobs": [{"token": "To", "logprob": -2.3297364711761475}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -1.9205795526504517}, {"token": " Japan", "logpro